msgid "A marathon. I'm tired just watching."
msgstr "Un marathon. Rien que de regarder ça, ça me fatigue."

#: modules/critter/reaction_lines.lua:359
msgid "A month. I kept busy. Mostly sulking."
msgstr "Un mois. Je me suis occupé. J'ai surtout boudé."

#: modules/critter/dialog.lua:235
msgid "A mystery."
msgstr "Un mystère."

#: modules/critter/phrases.lua:180
msgid "A new book awaits!"
